WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.439
Today is the final check. It takes about five minutes.

2
00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:07.256
Your child uses their page. You have the grown-up page.

3
00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:12.699
It has three parts. Read and do. One sentence at a time. And a new story.

4
00:00:13.149 --> 00:00:16.960
Do not help today, and do not read anything out loud for your child.

5
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.022
Your child has never seen these sentences or this story. So nothing here can be remembered.

6
00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:28.541
For the story, cover it with your hand and say: tell me what happened. Mark each part you hear.

7
00:00:28.991 --> 00:00:31.388
Then your child draws the story in the box.

8
00:00:31.838 --> 00:00:36.267
Write the three numbers on your page. Then put it beside the page from day one.

9
00:00:36.717 --> 00:00:40.915
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

10
00:00:41.365 --> 00:00:46.510
If it is not there yet, that is a result too. The page tells you which days to do again.

11
00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.628
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
